# Console state written by the HTML console's "Save → repo" (File System
# Access API). It is a backup of this browser's ccg:* localStorage — working
# state, not source. Ignored so it is never committed by accident.
#
# Credentials are excluded from that file by the console itself (see
# SECRET_KEYS / isSecretKey in claude-code-guide-v2.html), so this is the
# second layer, not the only one. Delete this entry only if you have a
# deliberate reason to version console state.
.cycle/console-state.json

# Local scratch
*.log
node_modules/
